 "_spec": "covenant@2:297ca24fdcef",
 "content": [
  {
   "signature": "",
   "thinking": "",
   "type": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "text": "{\"recommendation\":\"escalate\",\"explanation\":\"The Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio for the four quarters ended September 30, 2026 came out at {{fact:3e25c14d-37d3-40d2-b995-7f155db348fd}}. Section 6.1 requires at least {{fact:96526fb0-3f31-4d0a-a1ea-1eed755f60f1}}, so the ratio falls short by {{fact:47368e5d-9530-498c-bb3f-6ccd8b1b8bf5}} of the requirement. The borrower's Q3 2026 compliance certificate reports the same ratio, {{fact:70093d31-8e18-4b20-a9b5-90bc20f9d671}}, and says the borrower was not in compliance. The definition uses no add-backs, so no cap could explain the gap. The only approved terms on file come from the original credit agreement. There are no unapproved amendments, and a search of the documents found no waiver. Section 9.1 says a waiver is effective only if it is in writing and signed by both the lender and the borrower. Rerunning the test under the approved terms gave the same result, {{fact:4a01a847-3b11-47e8-b538-603055c22c4a}} against {{fact:20e9ee29-1b9a-4f60-98f9-7fc0b260abbd}}. Nothing on file explains the failure, so this looks like a true breach.\",\"claims\":[{\"text\":\"Section 6.1 sets the minimum Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio, measured on the last four fiscal quarters.\",\"document_id\":\"4d82ecf3-1e7b-494b-b231-d02b8bf1e7e6\",\"page\":8,\"quote\":\"The Borrower shall not permit the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio,\\nmeasured as of the last day of each fiscal quarter for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters\\nthen ended, to be less than 1.35 to 1.00.\"},{\"text\":\"The borrower's Q3 2026 compliance certificate says it was not in compliance with the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio.\",\"document_id\":\"facc47aa-1e4f-45b4-b66d-d61649e86dc7\",\"page\":1,\"quote\":\"As of September 30, 2026, the Borrower was not in compliance with the following financial covenant: Fixed Charge\\nCoverage Ratio.\"},{\"text\":\"Under the credit agreement, a waiver is effective only if it is in writing and signed by both the lender and the borrower.\",\"document_id\":\"4d82ecf3-1e7b-494b-b231-d02b8bf1e7e6\",\"page\":9,\"quote\":\"No amendment or waiver of any provision of this Agreement shall be effective unless it is in writing and signed by the Lender and the Borrower\"}],\"calc_ids\":[\"1c16f09a-c51a-4b5b-9af7-5d83aab98236\",\"a92b3e85-69ae-4462-9ea3-1d893b708941\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"suggested_tag\":\"true_breach\"}",
   "type": "text"
  }
 ],
